OL,3,GNEWSAYoung Muslims awarded for being   
OL,4,Acommunity pioneers                     
OL,6,FAn inaugural awards ceremony was set up
OL,7,Fto recognise the achievements of young 
OL,8,FMuslims and challenge "negative        
OL,9,Fperspectives and stereotypes", its     
OL,10,Ffounder has said.                      
OL,12,FThe Community Pioneers Awards will take
OL,13,Fplace on Sunday at the Chrysalis       
OL,14,FTheatre, Milton Keynes.                
OL,16,FSharif Hassan, 20, who made the city   
OL,17,Fhis home after leaving Sudan in 2020,  
OL,18,Fwill be given the Special Recognition  
OL,19,FYoung Leader Award at the ceremony.    
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
